OL,3,AUS envoys meet Putin in Moscow for
OL,4,AUkraine talks
OL,5,
OL,6,FUS President Donald Trump's top
OL,7,Fnegotiators have met Russian President
OL,8,FVladimir Putin in Moscow, as efforts to
OL,9,Fend the war in Ukraine gather pace.
OL,11,FFootage released by the Kremlin showed
OL,12,FSteve Witkoff and Jared Kushner being
OL,13,Fgreeted by Putin, who said the current
OL,14,Fsituation "is not so easy". He added
OL,15,FRussia would explain "how we see the
OL,16,Fsituation".
OL,18,FWitkoff thanked Putin for agreeing with
OL,19,FUkraine to halt strikes on each other's
OL,20,Fcapitals for three days. On Sunday the
OL,21,Fenvoys will travel to Kyiv for more
OL,22,Ftalks.
OL,23,APub: 05-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
