OL,3,AUS envoys meet Putin in Moscow for
OL,4,AUkraine talks
OL,5,
OL,6,FOn Friday, Trump said Witkoff and
OL,7,FKushner were "bringing with them a
OL,8,Fproposal to end the war". So far,
OL,9,Fefforts by the US and its allies to
OL,10,Fbroker a peace deal have failed.
